  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Hi all，</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">【星座&middot;对对碰】活动将于1.5日进入测试阶段，现申请相关资源及礼物配置。</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">辛苦@叶导 审批，&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">辛苦@灿灿配置并返回相关id。<br /></span></p><p style=\"\"><br /></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">具体需求如下：</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">1、 礼物配置：</span></p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 22.3159%;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 20.0805%;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 25.3892%;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 22.1578%;\" /> <col style=\"width: 8.53999%;\" /><col style=\"width: 23.7517%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>礼物属性</td><td>礼物名称</td><td>礼物价格</td><td>url</td><td>备注</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"20\">BB礼物</td><td>许愿瓶</td><td>33</td><td><br /></td><td>1</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>十里桃花</td><td>52</td><td><br /></td><td>1</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>花间星河</td><td>99</td><td><br /></td><td>1</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>大盲盒</td><td>111</td><td><br /></td><td>1</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>洗香香</td><td>138</td><td><br /></td><td>1</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>动次打次</td><td>199</td><td><br /></td><td>1</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>竹林深处</td><td>210</td><td><br /></td><td>1</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>熊猫竹韵</td><td>288</td><td><br /></td><td>1</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>神秘玛雅</td><td>333</td><td><br /></td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>永恒之恋</td><td>520</td><td><br /></td><td>1</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>月兔传情</td><td>520</td><td><br /></td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>烟花秀</td><td>999</td><td><br /></td><td>1</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>祥云火箭</td><td>999</td><td><br /></td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>星澜之约</td><td>1111</td><td><br /></td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>把你送给我</td><td>1314</td><td><br /></td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>真爱永恒手链</td><td>2000</td><td><br /></td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>青蛇幽梦</td><td>2333</td><td><br /></td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>仙女秋千</td><td>2888</td><td><br /></td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>海岛之恋</td><td>5200</td><td><br /></td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>霸主征服</td><td>9999</td><td><br /></td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\" style=\"\">2、资源配置</p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 30.0802%;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 14.8861%;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 26.0079%;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 15.5705%;\" /> <col style=\"width: 6.33087%;\" /><col style=\"width: 37.1297%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>属性</td><td>礼物名称</td><td><p>资源id</p></td><td>url</td><td>备注</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>座驾</td><td>飞跃天际进房座驾</td><td>7427</td><td><br /></td><td>二期对对碰，长期在线，勿复用</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>座驾</td><td>宇宙顶流进房座驾</td><td>2154</td><td><br /></td><td>二期对对碰，长期在线，勿复用</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\" style=\"\">以上，如有问题及时沟通～</p>",
